# case: 310-agent-utilities-delivered
# what: libatomic1 is dropped from the essentials layer as unused -- nothing
#       else in the Dockerfile uses it, and every image built before Node 26
#       became the LTS (2026-10-28) ran node without it.
#
#       From Node 26 the official Linux node binaries link libatomic.so.1. The
#       pyenv layer's build-essential brings the library in as a gcc
#       dependency, and the cleanup purge's --auto-remove takes it away again.
#       The default variant runs node in no layer, so it still builds: the
#       finished image keeps node on PATH, and `node --version` dies at exec
#       with "libatomic.so.1: cannot open shared object file", npm and npx
#       with it. (A variant with yarn, pnpm, bun, angular-cli or playwright
#       fails to build instead, at that layer's npm.)
#
#       Expected: exactly THREE assertions fail, `node`, `npm` and `npx` FAILED
#       TO RUN, and the other eleven tools still pass. A run where node RUNS
#       means the default variant installed a node that does not need the
#       library (the LTS moved, or the variant kept build-essential), or some
#       other default-image package pulls libatomic1 back in, and this patch
#       then demonstrates nothing.
#
#       Demonstrated locally on 2026-10-28: this patch applied, the default
#       variant's minimal sandbox.conf, `./build.sh --no-cache` (nvm installed
#       v26.13.0), then `run.sh --reuse-image --cases
#       310-agent-utilities-delivered` against that image. Exactly that --
#       `node`, `npm` and `npx` FAILED TO RUN on "libatomic.so.1: cannot open
#       shared object file", the other eleven PASSed.
#
#       NEEDS A REBUILD, like 310-make-not-installed: it changes the Dockerfile.
#       And WITHOUT THE CACHE: with this patch applied the Dockerfile is the one
#       from before the fix up to the nvm layer, so a build cache from before
#       2026-10-28 hands back an nvm layer holding Node 24, which needs no
#       libatomic, and the case passes having demonstrated nothing. That
#       happened on the first local try (case 310 PASSed in 27 s).
diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
--- a/Dockerfile
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -34,7 +34,6 @@
   openssh-client \
   libcap2-bin \
   unzip zip \
-  libatomic1 \
   tcpdump \
   tshark && \
   rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
